BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-198808@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260901T190000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T203000
SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Survival Mode & What It's Costing You
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unlimit
 ed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198808\n\n7:00PM Re
 ception\, 7:30PM Discussion\nIn a world that celebrates constant achieveme
 nt\, many founders and executives spend more time in survival mode than th
 ey realize. The cost can show up in their clarity\, decision-making\, rela
 tionships\, health\, and ultimately\, how they lead.\n\nJoin international
 ly recognized keynote speaker\, leadership advisor\, and bestselling autho
 r Unni Turrettini for an illuminating evening exploring what happens when 
 pressure becomes your default state\, why even highly successful people ca
 n get stuck there\, and how your internal state affects the way you think\
 , work\, and make decisions.\n\nDrawing from her research and global caree
 r spanning law\, finance\, and leadership development\, Unni will share pr
 actical insights into recognizing your own survival mode patterns and shif
 ting into a state where you can think more clearly\, make better decisions
 \, and perform under pressure without it taking such a personal toll.\n\nF
 ollowing the discussion\, members are invited to participate in an interac
 tive Q&A and book signing of Unni’s newest release\, Soulware: A High A
 chiever’s Guide to Divine Connection in the Age of AI.\n\nThis event is 
 complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary lite bites and 
 refreshments will be served\, and copies of Soulware will be available for
  purchase.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198808
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
